    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 20.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forðam eall þæt we æfre for rihthlafordhylde doð, eall we doð hit us sylfum to mycelre ðéarfe, forðam ðam bið witodlice God hold ðe biþ his hlaforde rihtlice hold.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">For all that we ever do, through just fidelity to our lord, we do to our own great advantage, for truly God shall be gracious to him who is justly faithful to his lord.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Forðam eall þæt we æfre for rihthlafordhelde doð, eall we hit doð us sylfum to mycelre þearfe; forþam byð witodlice God hold, þe byð his hlaforde rihtlice hold.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
